# J1: local testing with `wrangler pages dev` (docs/JEV-SPIKE.md). Copy to .dev.vars,
# which git ignores. Neither value does anything on the deployed site: the dev email is
# honoured only when the request's host is localhost, and the deployed Pages project
# never sets JEV_MOCK.

# Stands in for the Cloudflare Access login on this machine only.
ACCESS_DEV_EMAIL=you@example.com

# 1 = answer from app/static/js/jev/mock.js (no account, no key, no cost).
JEV_MOCK=1

# To ask the real Jev through OpenRouter: remove JEV_MOCK above and set your key here.
# This file is ignored by git; never put the key anywhere that is committed.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
